{
    "title": "Little Panda's Town: Vacation",
    "description": "Vacation begins! Have you made any vacation plans? If not, come to Little Panda's Town: Vacation! It can meet all your expectations about vacations: beaches,\u00a0 swimming pools, amusement parks, snow mountains and so much more! Welcome to this fantastic holiday park that is just for you!\r\n\r\nCREATION\r\nCan you imagine this? A fantastic vacation island of your own! Yes, you can create it freely! Want a big swimming pool, a ski resort, or an amusement park? Unleash your creativity and the dream island will be before your eyes with a few taps!\r\n\r\nPLAY\r\nIf you want to feel the speed, then come to the snow mountain and join the skiing contest! If you want to feel cool, you can play in the water at the water park!\u00a0 If you don't feel exciting enough, the alien themed park will bring you more thrilling experience!\r\n\r\nRELAXING\r\nThe vacation is a great time to relax! Soak in the hot springs and let them take away your fatigue! hold a beach volleyball competition with your friends! Or, camp in the park and feel the quiet of the night!\r\n\r\nEXPLORATION\r\nHere exploration and play will never end: treasures on the beach, codes in the cave and more! With curiosity, you will keep finding new things! Write down all these interesting discoveries in your vacation diary!\r\n\r\nYou have more plans about the vacation? Then come to Little Panda's Town: Vacation and start the perfect vacation time together!\r\n\r\nFEATURES: \r\n- Six areas: amusement park, beach, snow hill and more;\r\n- Interesting vacation events to join: camping, going to a hot spring and more;\r\n- Lots of delicious food to enjoy on vacation: BBQ food and smoothies;\r\n- New items are added to the game according to popular factors;\r\n- Nearly 700 items to use across scenes;\r\n- Nearly 50 characters to spend vacation with you; \r\n- Use expression and action stickers to bring characters to life;\r\n-An open world without rules!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Vacation begins! Have you made any vacation plans? If not, come to Little Panda&#39;s Town: Vacation! It can meet all your expectations about vacations: beaches,\u00a0 swimming pools, amusement parks, snow mountains and so much more! Welcome to this fantastic holiday park that is just for you!<br><br>CREATION<br>Can you imagine this? A fantastic vacation island of your own! Yes, you can create it freely! Want a big swimming pool, a ski resort, or an amusement park? Unleash your creativity and the dream island will be before your eyes with a few taps!<br><br>PLAY<br>If you want to feel the speed, then come to the snow mountain and join the skiing contest! If you want to feel cool, you can play in the water at the water park!\u00a0 If you don&#39;t feel exciting enough, the alien themed park will bring you more thrilling experience!<br><br>RELAXING<br>The vacation is a great time to relax! Soak in the hot springs and let them take away your fatigue! hold a beach volleyball competition with your friends! Or, camp in the park and feel the quiet of the night!<br><br>EXPLORATION<br>Here exploration and play will never end: treasures on the beach, codes in the cave and more! With curiosity, you will keep finding new things! Write down all these interesting discoveries in your vacation diary!<br><br>You have more plans about the vacation? Then come to Little Panda&#39;s Town: Vacation and start the perfect vacation time together!<br><br>FEATURES: <br>- Six areas: amusement park, beach, snow hill and more;<br>- Interesting vacation events to join: camping, going to a hot spring and more;<br>- Lots of delicious food to enjoy on vacation: BBQ food and smoothies;<br>- New items are added to the game according to popular factors;<br>- Nearly 700 items to use across scenes;<br>- Nearly 50 characters to spend vacation with you; <br>- Use expression and action stickers to bring characters to life;<br>-An open world without rules!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
